  <prompt>The owner tested the Create Project wizard (UAT round 4, F-R4-2): in the Assign Work follow-on step the Assigned Attorney, Assigned Paralegal and Assigned Outside Counsel fields are inline type-ahead lookups. They must use the existing side-pane lookup (`DataverseLookupField`), as the Matter and Project Enter Info steps already do.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in React, Fluent UI v9 and the @spaarke/ui-components wizard framework (CreateRecordWizard, WizardShell).</role>
  <goal>Every create wizard that shows the Assign Work follow-on (Matter, Project, Event, Report Card; amended 2026-11-12: CreateInvoiceWizard has no Assign Work step) renders Assigned Attorney, Assigned Paralegal and Assigned Outside Counsel with `DataverseLookupField` over the host navigationService; without a navigationService the step renders exactly as today.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>Review section 2.1 row 1 and section 2.3. The step is `WizardFollowOns/steps/AssignWorkFollowOnStep.tsx` (fields at :307, :328, :336; "Assign to me" at :316-326) and has no navigationService prop (:48-100). `CreateRecordWizard`'s config carries a navigationService only inside associateToStep / existingRecordPicker (`CreateRecordWizard/types.ts:46, 311`). Every host already builds `createXrmNavigationService()` and passes it to the wizards (`Wizard/InAppWizardHost.tsx:208`).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/WizardFollowOns/steps/AssignWorkFollowOnStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateRecordWizard/types.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateRecordWizard/CreateRecordWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateMatterWizard/CreateMatterWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateProjectWizard/CreateProjectWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/CreateEventWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateReportCardWizard/CreateReportCardWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateProjectWizard/CreateProjectStep.tsx</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="178" status="pending">DataverseLookupField failure handling and filters</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="owner">Owner directive 2026-11-12, applies to every file this task touches: reuse the existing side-pane lookup (`DataverseLookupField` over `INavigationService.openLookup`) and the existing `EmailComposer`; never re-create either. A third rendering of the lookup pattern is a defect (review section 4 item 6).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Every component changed in this task stays in `@spaarke/ui-components` and receives Dataverse access only through injected services (`INavigationService`, `IDataService`, `authenticatedFetch`).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Every UI change in this task uses Fluent v9 and semantic tokens only; light and dark both fully themed.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Tests added in this task cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named in the acceptance criteria; anything beyond needs a one-line justification in the task notes. No numeric test target.</constraint>
    <constraint source="owner">Owner D-219 (2026-11-12, notes/decisions.md) Q1: every lookup uses the side pane, reference tables included (Matter Type, Practice Area, Event Type, other *_ref tables); only option sets stay dropdowns. The pane entityType is the table the field's current search already queries.</constraint>
    <constraint source="owner">Every contact (person) field converted in this task passes `filters` limiting the pane to active contacts: [{ entityLogicalName: "contact", filterXml: '&lt;filter&gt;&lt;condition attribute="statecode" operator="eq" value="0"/&gt;&lt;/filter&gt;' }] (Owner D-219 (2026-11-12, notes/decisions.md) Q6). Put this filter in ONE exported constant beside DataverseLookupField and import it; do not copy the XML.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The new config field is ONE optional top-level `navigationService?: INavigationService` on the CreateRecordWizard config; the existing associateToStep / existingRecordPicker fields are not changed.</constraint>
  </constraints>
  <knowledge>
